  "aiContextParagraph": "The incident centers on the death of Silva Nur Intania Putri, a 17-year-old high school student in Malang, East Java, who died following a severe assault by four peers. The victim was reportedly picked up by two female acquaintances before the fatal altercation occurred. Authorities have since taken the four suspects into custody, noting that they remain eligible to participate in their school examinations despite the ongoing criminal proceedings. Initial police investigations suggest the motive for the violence was a romantic grudge. The situation escalated on Friday, November 27, when a large crowd gathered at the residence of one of the suspects. The protest resulted in property damage to the house and the burning of two police vehicles stationed at the scene to manage the crowd. Family members of the deceased have publicly called for justice regarding the circumstances surrounding the fatal bullying incident.",
